[00:09.79]Why did I think that I could save them
[00:15.00]I only know how to make things worse
[00:19.98]I was asleep by their rigor mortis
[00:24.29]Why was I dreaming while they were gone
[00:40.07]I gave them oats and a little water
[00:43.45]Why did I think they were satisfied
