[01:20.57]The lingering smell of their burning flesh
[01:26.32]And I can't cry
[01:29.20]Cuz I'm occupied
[01:34.07]Tryna survive
[01:38.99]Yes, I might die, myself
[01:43.78]And I'm so cold
[01:48.54]Cuz I'm all alone
[01:53.25]Tryna get grown
